OL,3,AUganda will now take part in Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games after King's reassurance
OL,5,
OL,6,FUganda's military leaders have
OL,7,Fconfirmed their country will take part
OL,8,Fin Prince Harry's Invictus Games for
OL,9,Fwounded veterans, after saying last
OL,10,Fweek they were going to pull out of the
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FThe change of heart follows a phone
OL,14,Fcall with the King's principal private
OL,15,Fsecretary, Sir Clive Alderton, who told
OL,16,Fthem the King had "no problem" with
OL,17,FUganda's participation in the games.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
