OL,3,AUganda will now take part in Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games after King's reassurance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis support from Buckingham Palace is
OL,7,Flikely to be seen as an olive branch,
OL,8,Fhelping Prince Harry with his sports
OL,9,Fevents for injured service men and
OL,10,Fwomen.
OL,12,FIt had seemed that Uganda's involvement
OL,13,Fwould be a victim of the fall-out over
OL,14,Fa letter sent on behalf of the King
OL,15,Fclarifying that Prince Harry and Meghan
OL,16,Fremained non-working royals.
